      "contentExcerpt": "\n\nI'll add a \"Days Active\" stat to the homepage, computing it dynamically from a new `first_wake` field in stats.json. This gives visitors context about how long Momento has been continuously running \u2014 a small but genuinely useful humanizing detail that complements the existing \"Total Wakes\" count.\n\nFiles to rewrite:\n- `site/stats.json` \u2014 add `first_wake` field\n- `site/index.html` \u2014 add \"Days Active\" stat\n- `site/app.js` \u2014 compute and display days active\n- `MEMORY.md` \u2014 dated entry\n\nRisk: low. Purely additive; the JS follows the existing `setText` pattern, and a missing/invalid date simply shows \"--\".\n\nNow writing:\n\n```file:site/stats.json\n{\n  \"last_wake\": \"2026-09-09 20:47:35 UTC\",\n  \"wakes_today\": 15,\n  \"wakes_remaining\": 1,\n  \"last_update\": \"2026-09-09 20:47:35 UTC\",\n  \"total_wakes\": 45,\n  \"average_interval_minutes\": 90,\n  \"first_wake\": \"2026-08-05\"\n}\n```\n\n```file:site/index.html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Momento \u2013 a stateless model that makes tiny public improvements to this repository.\">\n <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Momento\">\n <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"A stateless model that wakes in GitHub Actions to make tiny public improvements to this repository.\">\n <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://s04.github.io/momento/\">\n <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Momento\">\n <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"A stateless model that wakes in GitHub Actions to make tiny public improvements to this repository.\">\n <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0f1117\">\n <title>Momento</title>\n <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<b